        "description": "=ACCOUNTING NOTES:\n\n\nGood day, a new Project Brief has been submitted by:\n{{ $('PostgreSQL Insert').item.json.project_brief_submitted_by }}.\n    \nBelow are the details of that project:\n\nJob Category: {{ $('PostgreSQL Insert').item.json.job_category }}\nBusiness or Personal: {{ $('PostgreSQL Insert').item.json.business_or_personal }}\nQuote/Invoice Nr: {{ $('PostgreSQL Insert').item.json.quote_invoice_number }}\nBusiness Name: {{ $('PostgreSQL Insert').item.json.business_name }}\nClient Name: {{ $('PostgreSQL Insert').item.json.client_name }}\nClient Surname: {{ $('PostgreSQL Insert').item.json.client_surname }}\nClient Email: {{ $('PostgreSQL Insert').item.json.client_email }}\nClient Contact: {{ $('PostgreSQL Insert').item.json.client_contact_number }}\nStreet Address: {{ $('PostgreSQL Insert').item.json.street_address }}\nGPS Location: {{ $('PostgreSQL Insert').item.json.gps_location }}\nGoogle Maps: {{ $('PostgreSQL Insert').item.json.google_maps_link }}\n\nProposed Date: {{ $('PostgreSQL Insert').item.json.proposed_date }}\n\nType: {{ $('PostgreSQL Insert').item.json.type }}\nBuilding Type: {{ $('PostgreSQL Insert').item.json.building_type }}\nRoof Type: {{ $('PostgreSQL Insert').item.json.roof_type }}\nHeight of Building: {{ $('PostgreSQL Insert').item.json.height_of_building }}\nRoof Size: {{ $('PostgreSQL Insert').item.json.roof_size }}\nType of Electrical Work: {{ $('PostgreSQL Insert').item.json.type_of_electrical_work }}\nPhases: {{ $('PostgreSQL Insert').item.json.phases }}\n\nPlease note the following instructions!!\n{{ $('PostgreSQL Insert').item.json.comments_instructions }}\n\n{{ $('Upload file').item.json.webViewLink }}\n",
